# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and fill in. Only the maintainer's online builders for public material
# (the precedent corpus and public legal references) read credentials here. The case workspace and
# the full analysis app never read them: case content stays with local Ollama. Keys never enter
# browser code, and private documents are never sent to these cloud providers.
#
# Google Gemini API key, used only to extract fact patterns from PUBLIC precedent documents.
# Use a paid-tier key: Google may use data sent on the free tier to improve its products.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional Groq PUBLIC LEGAL REFERENCE builder. Never expose the key in Vite/browser code.
# Case workspace content always uses local Ollama, including published-origin cases.
GROQ_API_KEY=
GROQ_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-120b
